</div>
</div>
<p>In order to discover non-linear boundaries, we can use the <code>SpectralClustering</code> method. It uses the graph of nearest neighbors to compute a higher-dimensional representation of the data, and then assigns labels using a <em>k</em>-means algorithm:</p>
<div id="cell-23" class="cell" data-quarto-private-1="{&quot;key&quot;:&quot;colab&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:{}}" data-outputid="0132ad13-d76d-4296-82cd-11a17305f8b9" data-execution_count="10">
